    "enUS": {
      "description": "Wonderful, wonderful.\n\n<Lotwil looks up at you for a moment before going back to his shackles.>\n\nGo speak to Lucien, {name}. I need a cog #5. Bring it to me, will you?",
      "dialogue": {
        "868ac0f00e49b62d5883": "Cog #5, huh? Yeah, this isn't going to be good.",
        "bad22177b50762d3b6f3": "Wonderful, wonderful.$B$B<Lotwil looks up at you for a moment before going back to his shackles.>$B$BGo speak to Lucien, $N. I need a cog #5. Bring it to me, will you?"
